title: Anniversary of the Republic.
subtitle: The Republic celebrates it's eleventh anniversary!
face-image: img/russiacelebrate.jpg
on-arrival: streetviolence = 1
tags: event
view-if: year = 1930 and month = 3 
priority: 2
max-visits: 1

Today marks the eleventh anniversary of the February Revolution, and in turn the Russian Democratic Federative Republic! Social Democrats, Liberals, and Narodists nation-wide are taking part in jubilees to celebrate our continued freedom from Tsarist autocracy! What a time to be alive!

- @petrogradvio

@petrogradvio
title: Shots are heard in Petrograd.
subtitle: Armed Solidarists are attempting to disrupt celebrations in Petrograd! 
face-image: img/petrogradvio.jpeg

Members of the Russian National Youth League (SRNM), a Solidarist-aligned "youth organization", have attacked Soviet-organized celebrations across the city. Casualties are already in the dozens, gunshots echo through the streets of Petrograd, action must be taken immediately!

- @bansrnm
- @nothingeverhappens

@bansrnm
title: Rally local forces and issue a ban on the Solidarist paramilitary.
subtitle: The Esfe, Police, and National Militia will do what they can to fend off these terrorists.
unavailable-subtitle: We aren't in government.
choose-if: rsdrp_in_government = 1 and interior_minister_party = "RSDRP"
on-arrival: strife += 2; sa_strength *= 0.85; workers_nts += 2; new_middle_nts += 2; old_middle_nts += 3; rural_nts += 2; unemployed_nts += 3; republicanism += 3; sa_banned = 1
face-image: img/streetfighting2.jpg

The Esfe, Militsiya, and loyal portions of the Petrograd Politsiya have managed to fend off the Solidarists, dealing and taking a great deal of damage. Despite our losses, this represents a victory for Republicanism.

Radicalism is on the rise. **Streetfighting is now unlocked.**

@nothingeverhappens
title: Deploy the Soyuz Fevralya.
subtitle: The Esfe will have trouble stopping the highly militarized and radical Solidarists on such short notice.
unavailable-subtitle: We are in government and can use better methods to solve this.
on-arrival: strife += 2; sa_strength *= 0.65; workers_nts += 2; new_middle_nts += 3; old_middle_nts += 6; rural_nts += 4; unemployed_nts += 5; republicanism -= 5
face-image: img/streetfighting2.jpg

The Esfe and loyal portions of the Petrograd Politsiya mount a valiant defense against the SRNM, inflicting a great deal damage, but have ultimately been forced to flee under the force of the radicals.

Radicalism is on the rise. **Streetfighting is now unlocked.**

